'''Karasu-Tengu Tenten''' was an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that is exclusive to the VIP [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] Gacha, only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

